# Student Profile

@body

- Include a picture of your face
- Answer the following questions about yourself\:
  - what are your career goals? what is your favorite biology subject? what would you like to learn in this class? what are you nervous about in this class? what is your favorite local restaurant? what is one interesting thing that you did over the break?
- Link available on Blackboard.
- Complete it within the first two weeks of class.

